7. Impact Assessment
7.1. GWP for Biowaste Treatment by the BSFL
Seven of the twelve analysed LCA studies on BSFL reported results relating to the GWP associated with BSFL biowaste treatment. Food waste collected from various sources was the main type of organic waste. However, Ites et al. [170] also reported GWP results for specific waste materials such as brewery grains, potato peels, and expired food products. Figure 3 shows the calculated GWP scores per ton of biotreated waste from the LCA studies analysed.
